Source: yam
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Thomas Sawyer <transfire@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/trans/yam
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libyam0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: fast YAML 1.2 parser and emitter library (runtime)
 yam is a fast, minimal, zero-copy YAML 1.2 parser and emitter written in C11.
 It features a SIMD-accelerated scanner (selected at runtime), an event-based
 parser, an emitter with block/flow/minimal styles, merge key expansion,
 alias resolution, and an arena allocator.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libyam-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libyam0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: fast YAML 1.2 parser and emitter library (development files)
 yam is a fast, minimal, zero-copy YAML 1.2 parser and emitter written in C11.
 It features a SIMD-accelerated scanner (selected at runtime), an event-based
 parser, an emitter with block/flow/minimal styles, merge key expansion,
 alias resolution, and an arena allocator.
 .
 This package contains the headers, the static library, the development
 symlink, and the pkg-config file needed to build against yam.
